      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings: Revenues exceed analysts expectations while EPS lags behind",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.92 (up from ₹0.78 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹6.73b (up 12% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹1.39b (up 17% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 21% (in line with 3Q 2025). Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 2.9%. Earnings per share (EPS) missed analyst estimates by 8.0%. Revenue is forecast to grow 6.7% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 3.4% growth forecast for the Retail REITs industry in Asia.",
